# Grandfathered legacy files for scripts/forbid_cyrillic_finder.sh
#
# These test files carry Cyrillic find.text('…') finders written BEFORE the
# i18n-finder gate existed. They are frozen here so the gate is GREEN today
# while still blocking NEW Cyrillic finders in every other (and every
# freshly-authored) test file. This is a RATCHET: when one of these files is
# next meaningfully edited, convert its find.text('<Cyrillic>') calls to
# Keys / find.bySemanticsLabel / AppLocalizations and DELETE its line here.
# The baseline only ever shrinks. One repo-relative path per line.
#
# Generated 2026-06-24 from the then-current corpus.
